---@field DBParameterGroupFamily aws.rds.String The DB cluster parameter group family name. A DB cluster parameter group can be associated with one and only one DB cluster parameter group family, and can be applied only to a DB cluster running a database engine and engine version compatible with that DB cluster parameter group family.
---@field Description aws.rds.String The description for the DB cluster parameter group.
---@field Tags? aws.rds.TagList Tags to assign to the DB cluster parameter group.

