---@field Region? aws.rds.String The Amazon Web Services Region associated with the automated backup.
---@field DBInstanceIdentifier? aws.rds.String The identifier for the source DB instance, which can't be changed and which is unique to an Amazon Web Services Region.
---@field RestoreWindow? aws.rds.RestoreWindow The earliest and latest time a DB instance can be restored to.
---@field AllocatedStorage? aws.rds.Integer The allocated storage size for the automated backup in gibibytes (GiB).
