---@field NetworkType? aws.rds.String The network type of the DB cluster.
---@field ServerlessV2ScalingConfiguration? aws.rds.ServerlessV2ScalingConfiguration
---@field MonitoringInterval? aws.rds.IntegerOptional The interval, in seconds, between points when Enhanced Monitoring metrics are collected for the DB cluster. To turn off collecting Enhanced Monitoring metrics, specify 0.
