---@field PerformanceInsightsRetentionPeriod? aws.rds.IntegerOptional The number of days to retain Performance Insights data.
---@field CloudwatchLogsExportConfiguration? aws.rds.CloudwatchLogsExportConfiguration The log types to be enabled for export to CloudWatch Logs for a specific DB instance.
