---@class aws.rds.OptionGroup
---@field OptionGroupName? aws.rds.String Specifies the name of the option group.
---@field OptionGroupDescription? aws.rds.String Provides a description of the option group.
---@field EngineName? aws.rds.String Indicates the name of the engine that this option group can be applied to.
---@field MajorEngineVersion? aws.rds.String Indicates the major engine version associated with this option group.
---@field Options? aws.rds.OptionsList Indicates what options are available in the option group.
---@field AllowsVpcAndNonVpcInstanceMemberships? aws.rds.Boolean Indicates whether this option group can be applied to both VPC and non-VPC instances. The value true indicates the option group can be applied to both VPC and non-VPC instances.
---@field VpcId? aws.rds.String If AllowsVpcAndNonVpcInstanceMemberships is false, this field is blank. If AllowsVpcAndNonVpcInstanceMemberships is true and this field is blank, then this option group can be applied to both VPC and non-VPC instances. If this field contains a value, then this option group can only be applied to instances that are in the VPC indicated by this field.
---@field OptionGroupArn? aws.rds.String Specifies the Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the option group.
---@field SourceOptionGroup? aws.rds.String Specifies the name of the option group from which this option group is copied.
---@field SourceAccountId? aws.rds.String Specifies the Amazon Web Services account ID for the option group from which this option group is copied.
---@field CopyTimestamp? aws.rds.TStamp Indicates when the option group was copied.
---@field SourceRegion? aws.rds.String Specifies the Amazon Web Services Region for the option group from which this option group is copied.

