---Available option.
---@class aws.rds.OptionGroupOption
---@field Name? aws.rds.String The name of the option.
---@field Description? aws.rds.String The description of the option.
---@field EngineName? aws.rds.String The name of the engine that this option can be applied to.
---@field MajorEngineVersion? aws.rds.String Indicates the major engine version that the option is available for.
---@field MinimumRequiredMinorEngineVersion? aws.rds.String The minimum required engine version for the option to be applied.
---@field PortRequired? aws.rds.Boolean Indicates whether the option requires a port.
---@field DefaultPort? aws.rds.IntegerOptional If the option requires a port, specifies the default port for the option.
---@field OptionsDependedOn? aws.rds.OptionsDependedOn The options that are prerequisites for this option.
---@field OptionsConflictsWith? aws.rds.OptionsConflictsWith The options that conflict with this option.
---@field Persistent? aws.rds.Boolean Persistent options can't be removed from an option group while DB instances are associated with the option group. If you disassociate all DB instances from the option group, your can remove the persistent option from the option group.
---@field Permanent? aws.rds.Boolean Permanent options can never be removed from an option group. An option group containing a permanent option can't be removed from a DB instance.
---@field RequiresAutoMinorEngineVersionUpgrade? aws.rds.Boolean If true, you must enable the Auto Minor Version Upgrade setting for your DB instance before you can use this option. You can enable Auto Minor Version Upgrade when you first create your DB instance, or by modifying your DB instance later.
---@field VpcOnly? aws.rds.Boolean If true, you can only use this option with a DB instance that is in a VPC.
---@field SupportsOptionVersionDowngrade? aws.rds.BooleanOptional If true, you can change the option to an earlier version of the option. This only applies to options that have different versions available.
---@field OptionGroupOptionSettings? aws.rds.OptionGroupOptionSettingsList The option settings that are available (and the default value) for each option in an option group.
---@field OptionGroupOptionVersions? aws.rds.OptionGroupOptionVersionsList The versions that are available for the option.
---@field CopyableCrossAccount? aws.rds.BooleanOptional Indicates whether the option can be copied across Amazon Web Services accounts.
---@field CopyableCrossRegion? aws.rds.BooleanOptional Indicates whether the option can be copied across Amazon Web Services Regions.

---Option group option settings are used to display settings available for each option with their default values and other information. These values are used with the DescribeOptionGroupOptions action.
