---@field ApplyType? aws.rds.String The DB engine specific parameter type for the option group option.
---@field AllowedValues? aws.rds.String Indicates the acceptable values for the option group option.
---@field IsModifiable? aws.rds.Boolean Indicates whether this option group option can be changed from the default value.
---@field IsRequired? aws.rds.Boolean Indicates whether a value must be specified for this option setting of the option group option.
---@field MinimumEngineVersionPerAllowedValue? aws.rds.MinimumEngineVersionPerAllowedValueList The minimum DB engine version required for the corresponding allowed value for this option setting.

---@alias aws.rds.OptionGroupOptionSettingsList aws.rds.OptionGroupOptionSetting[]

